=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595450/extras/b89931fdea8a3873fb5d89a15ce569ba.mp4?t=1770548519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the horizon, a tower stands tall, untouched by the decay. The only structure tall enough to carry a distress call from the last isolated soul on this forgotten planet. This might be your way out.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your way there you'll uncover an ancient conflict which led to this world being isolated and abandoned for thousands of years, until you came here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595450/extras/578008ce2e55686896f30e93e9f9f809.poster.avif?t=1770548519\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595450/extras/578008ce2e55686896f30e93e9f9f809.webm?t=1770548519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595450/extras/578008ce2e55686896f30e93e9f9f809.mp4?t=1770548519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>For something to exist, it needs to be remembered, and everything that exists, eventually degrades.</i></p>","developers":["Slugware"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595450/33c4b1bf1e9af61e7396685043a32d61ee8b3b2f/header.jpg?t=1770548519","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Slugware AB. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3595450/2093279316/63b7b016119fb506ad1770eec337c